    LLM: 'Auction: first Raus (solo), then Rufen (call a King; holder is partner, unknown until play). Dealer may call a King in hand for concealed Raus. Forehand leads; follow suit; must trump if void. Ski is excuse (no trick power). 19 tricks.',
    Player: 'Auction: first Raus (solo), then Rufen (call a King; holder is partner, unknown until play). Dealer may call a King in hand for concealed Raus. Forehand leads; follow suit; must trump if void. Ski is excuse (no trick power). 19 tricks.',
    objective: "In Rufen: caller's team wins by scoring more than half the card points after each side counts to 23. In Raus: soloist wins by outscoring the best of the three opponents (they do not pool tricks).",
